        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "docs: default agent validation to remote runners",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nAgent sessions could run tests and broad validation locally because the repository guidance did not make remote execution or early Testbox warmup the default. Reused-box examples could also skip source sync, while contributor code lacked a safe remote routing boundary.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nMake Crabbox remote execution the agent default for tests and compute-heavy work, with early Blacksmith Testbox warmup and lease reuse for trusted maintainer code. Add a fail-closed direct-AWS path for untrusted PRs: trusted launcher/config, public networking without Tailscale, no instance role or hydrated credentials, immutable reviewed SHA, isolated home, and a checksum-verified pinned Node/pnpm bootstrap.\n\n## User Impact\n\nMaintainer agents should stop bogging down local Macs with test and validation workloads. Trusted work gets fast pre-warmed Testboxes; untrusted contributor code cannot inherit maintainer credentials, IAM roles, tailnet access, stale source, or a moving PR head.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- `git diff --check`\n- `node scripts/docs-list.js`\n- YAML frontmatter parsed for all three changed skills\n- `bash -n scripts/crabbox-untrusted-bootstrap.sh`\n- `shellcheck scripts/crabbox-untrusted-bootstrap.sh`\n- Bootstrap pnpm pin verified against `package.json`\n- Crabbox CLI flags verified for warmup, `--fresh-pr`, `--no-hydrate`, provider routing, shell execution, and timing JSON\n- Fresh autoreview completed with no accepted/actionable findings after security and network hardening\n- Exact-head direct AWS Crabbox proof: lease `cbx_e99a39d99a98`, run `run_ea7b74f23edf`, PR head `d2c61915b9f4d2cee98ee1e58cd18af363d54078`\n- `crabbox inspect` verified `network=public` with no Tailscale state before execution; the trusted script then passed IMDS no-role proof, Node archive checksum verification, Node `v24.15.0`, pnpm `11.2.2`, full frozen-lockfile install, and bootstrap-script syntax validation\n- Proof lease released after the run\n",
